 "summary": "Nine single Schottky rectifiers in the SMB (DO-214AA) surface-mount package, each rated 5.0 A average forward current and 120 A for an 8.3 ms half-sine surge. They differ in reverse voltage, from 20 V (SS52B) to 200 V (SS520B), and with it in forward drop (0.55 V to 0.95 V maximum at 5 A), reverse leakage and junction temperature limit. Named uses are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling and polarity protection. SS510B is the 100 V part.",
